1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="242.55" y="407.0" width="104.89999999999999" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Orange: external participant. Navy: transformation. Green open-ended symbol: retained data. * repeats the same participant or record family; it is not a new system/store. F1–F6 are logical record&lt;br&gt;bundles, expanded on the subsystem sheets. They group existing private stores; they do not assert a shared database. Repeated actors keep each subsystem interaction local.&lt;br&gt;F1: D1 (RW); F2: D1 (RW); F3: D1 (R), D2/D4 (RW); F4: D2/D3 (RW); F5: D1/D3 (R), D2/D5 (RW); F6: D2/D3 (R), D4 (RW). D1 identity/social; D2 content; D3 media/evidence; D4 conversation/memory; D5&lt;br&gt;playback/feed. Bundles retain private service ownership." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#253849;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1660" width="1520" height="92" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="05-dfd-auth" name="05 · D2 · Account and access"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1520" pageHeight="1340.0" grid="1" semanticModel="{&quot;page&quot;:&quot;05&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;05-dfd-auth&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;D2 · Account and access&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;logical-dfd&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;parent&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;auth&quot;,&quot;nodes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;p1&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Validate account&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;process&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:&quot;1.1&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;P1.1&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/api-gateway/src/auth/guards/jwt-auth.guard.ts:1-60&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/prisma/schema.prisma:1-45&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/application/use-cases/login.use-case.ts:1-79&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/auth-service/src/application/use-cases/logout.use-case.ts:1-33