ord family; it is not a new system/store. Accept-original includes mobile direct upload. Presigning binds one publishIntentId to a deterministic user-owned key and 24-hour Content upload lease; the signed PUT expires in 300 seconds and returns 412 when already present. Media completion persists validated HLS/thumbnail and queues evidence; attempt fencing, source preservation and opt-in cleanup are sequences 27–31." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#253849;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="880" width="1460" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="08a-dfd-streaming" name="08a · D2 · HLS playback"><mxGraphModel page="0" pageWidth="1520" pageHeight="979.0" grid="1" semanticModel="{&quot;page&quot;:&quot;08a&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;08a-dfd-streaming&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;D2 · HLS playback&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;logical-dfd&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;parent&quot;:&quot;4.0&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;media&quot;,&quot;nodes&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;p1&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Select playback source&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;process&quot;,&quot;number&quot;:&quot;4.8&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;P4.8&quot;,&quot;evidence&quot;:[&quot;backend:apps/content-service/src/application/use-cases/complete-reel-media-processing.use-case.ts:1-46&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/media-processing-service/src/application/use-cases/prepare-reel-media.use-case.ts:1-644&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/media-service/src/application/use-cases/get-presigned-url.use-case.ts:1-103&quot;,&quot;backend:apps/media-service/src/infrastructure/services/s3.service.ts:1-165&quot;,&quot;mobile:src/components/reels/ReelVideo.tsx:1-669&quot;,&quot;mobile:src/hooks/useReels.ts:1-1678&quot;,&quot;mobile:src/hooks/useOfflineReelVideoSource.ts:32-239&quot;,&quot;mobile:src/lib/offlineReelVideoCache.ts:634-715&quot;],&quot;ownerComposi